Z||000014||Tigger||03-28-2001||12:00 PM||||I voted 10's for all the Fieros.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I noticed only a few cars overall had an average much higher than 5.  The average of the average for all the cars I saw was around 3.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  What is up with that?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  I would expect to see a 2.5 average for a stock Ford Escort, but I was suprised some really nice rides got almost the same rating.<P>Don't think I'm going to bother to post my Fiero.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  ||||reg||7
Z||000015||fyerstarter||03-28-2001||12:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by banditbalz:<BR><B>fyrestarter, does my car look stock? take a look at the scoops and rims. it runs 15.2 @ 90 mph. my sig is a joke. SlammedFiero teases me cause he thinks i got a 3.1 or a 3.4 As for the rating system, my mistake! I actually had 6 votes at 1 (not 0) out of 10.<P>Anybody gonna tell me how to post pics? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>My bad. I didn't actually give your car a "0" because I had no way of knowing which one was yours. I just assumed because of your sig that it was stock. Your right this rating thing doesn't appear to work too well. I saw a riced out Ford Escort there and I think it got a 5, then next I saw fst2m6's orange GT and I think it also got around a 5, and a pretty nice slammed mini truck (no not the ugly ones with the dripping paint graphics) and it also got 5-ish :\<P>I think the main reason for this is that car guys are far too biased. Just like if you guys saw a pretty nice ricer there youl'd prob give it a 1 and then several people have said they gave all the Fieros's a 10. It's no wonder the rating system doesn't work. A car shouldn't get a 10 just because it's a Fiero, just like your car doesn't deserve to get a 1 because some poeple don't like Fieros.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000016||TheFiero64||03-29-2001||12:42 PM||||I emailed the Site owner. <P>Here is what I said and the responce.<BR><B>I think you should have a members only voting. There is an unfair and childish group that keeps voting 1 just to be funny. They are doing it to certain makes of cars. I believe if members only were voting there would be less of these punks out there ruining the experience for the rest of us. I vote fair I wish others would too.<BR> <BR>Thanks,<BR>Josh</B><P>Here is the responce<BR><B>Hi Josh,<BR> <BR>Thank you for your response. RJ would love to have more users like you too visit us. We launched last tuesday and we are at half a million hits. So we have been going a little insane here thinking about what we need  to do next in order to make ridejudge better for our members. Our biggest complaint here has also been "what the heck is up with all those 1's". Trust us, that is our first subject on the priority list. We have a couple of ideas at RJ that will solve that problem, we just need to test it out. By the end of this weekend we will have that problem solved. We feel that no car regardless deserves so many "Damm" 1's, so we will work on that. If you have any more suggestions or concerns, please do not hesitate to let me know personally. We respect true Judge's like you.<BR> <BR>Thanks Again,<BR> <BR>Andres Burgos<BR>Operations Manager<BR>RideJudge.com</B><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
